# Backup files
###############################################################################

*.backup
*.old
*.orig
backend.conf
# Saved plan files without an extension
# Plan files, including suffixed ones like tfplan.destroy — they are binary,
# can be large, and a saved plan embeds resource attributes from state.
tfplan
tfplan.*
